        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "start": 1975.1,
          "end": 1983.1,
          "en": "We talk about this kind of structural shift that needs to happen with policy, but Robin, isn't this a really big picture, longer-term shift, right?",
          "zh": "我们谈到这种需要政策推动的结构性转变，但这不是一个更宏大、更长期的转变吗？",
