          "relative_start": 28.199999999999818,
          "relative_end": 36.19999999999982
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "start": 1983.1,
          "end": 1993.7,
          "en": "The government has been wanting to turn to domestic consumption for the last 10 years, 20 years, and it hasn't quite sort of happened to the strength that you might expect.",
          "zh": "过去10年、20年，政府一直想转向国内消费，但并未达到预期的力度。",
