          "index": 6,
          "start": 1993.7,
          "end": 2001.5,
          "en": "Is it possible, do you think, with major changes to social welfare, with major changes to what we've seen with the property sector, for example, to be able to turn around the demographic issues?",
          "zh": "你认为，通过社会福利和房地产领域的重大变革，能否扭转人口问题？",
