        "社保改革是关键"
      ],
      "title_highlights": [
        "2027",
        "社保改革"
      ],
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "start": 2015.5,
          "end": 2023.3,
          "en": "The housing sector is still in decline. In fact, housing investment as percentage of total economy declined from the peak level of 16% to 6%.",
          "zh": "房地产行业仍在下降。住房投资占经济总量的比例从16%的峰值下降到6%。",
          "zh_highlights": [
