          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "housing investment",
            "declined from 16% to 6%"
          ],
          "relative_start": 0.0,
          "relative_end": 7.7999999999999545
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "start": 2023.3,
          "end": 2032.9,
          "en": "Basically, home buyers are holding their cash, and we do not see a true bottom for the housing sector, and here may be late 2027.",
          "zh": "基本上，购房者持有现金，我们看不到房地产的真正底部，可能要到2027年底。",
