            "持有现金"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "holding their cash",
            "true bottom",
            "late 2027"
          ],
          "relative_start": 7.7999999999999545,
          "relative_end": 17.40000000000009
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "start": 2032.9,
          "end": 2042.5,
          "en": "So that's one factor. The other one is the major gap on social safety net.",
          "zh": "这是一个因素。另一个是社会保障网的巨大缺口。",
          "zh_highlights": [],
          "en_highlights": [
            "social safety net gap"
          ],
          "relative_start": 17.40000000000009,
          "relative_end": 27.0
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "start": 2042.5,
          "end": 2050.5,
          "en": "Migrant workers, lower income population, they don't have enough coverage or access to those benefits.",
          "zh": "农民工、低收入人群，他们没有足够的保障或享受这些福利。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "农民工",
            "低收入人群"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "Migrant workers",
            "lower income"
          ],
          "relative_start": 27.0,
          "relative_end": 35.0
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "start": 2050.5,
          "end": 2059.3,
          "en": "I know in a lot of policy debates, there is a certain view that consumption is just the consequence of income. You cannot boost the consumption. You should not do.",
          "zh": "我知道在很多政策辩论中，有一种观点认为消费只是收入的结果，不能刺激消费，也不应该刺激。",
