        {
          "index": 7,
          "start": 2068.7,
          "end": 2077.8,
          "en": "If job market remains weak, math is the falling home price. Naturally, people will lock their cash, lock their savings.",
          "zh": "如果就业市场依然疲软，加上房价下跌，人们自然会锁定现金和储蓄。",
